    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the new crusader amongst the order of the almighty and must uphold the Almighty's teachings and serve out justice in his name! Will you be a paragon of justice, a punisher of the wicked, or will you use the power you wield to strike fear in the eyes of all? Looks like its gonna be quite the adventure for... Crusaderman!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional side-view turn-based battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyword based branching dialogue system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can challenge almost everyone to fights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Art made by myself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack developed by myself.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the new crusader amongst the order of the almighty and must uphold the Almighty's teachings and serve out justice in his name! Will you be a paragon of justice, a punisher of the wicked, or will you use the power you wield to strike fear in the eyes of all? Looks like its gonna be quite the adventure for... Crusaderman!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional side-view turn-based battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyword based branching dialogue system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can challenge almost everyone to fights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Art made by myself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack developed by myself.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dish out your own brand of justice in Crusaderman - a new exciting turn-based RPG!",
